<title>USA: Great Lakes Chemical authorizes share buy.</title>
<headline>Great Lakes Chemical authorizes share buy.</headline>
<dateline>WEST LAFAYETTE, Ind. 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Great Lakes Chemical Corp said Tuesday its board authorized the purchase of up to an additional four million shares of the company's approximate 63.3 million outstanding shares.</p>
<p>Purchases will be made from time to time in open market or privately negotiated transactions.</p>
<p>Since the stock buyback program's inception in April 1993, Great Lakes has repurchased more than nine million shares.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
